classDiagram
    direction LR

    class Room {
        +string code
        +number seed            // 同房同种子(整数[0,SEED_MAX], 建房生成)
        +string status          // waiting|playing|finished|opponent_left|abandoned
        +number createdAt
        +number startAt         // 第2人加入后写入: 双方本地时钟≥此值才开局(无WS同步补偿)
        +number ttl             // 600s (Redis key EXPIRE = 重连窗口)
        +boolean orphan         // waiting期房主退出标记(房间保留)
        +object players         // uid -> PlayerState
        +object results         // uid -> ResultState
        +number matchResult     // 0未定 1=P1胜 2=P2胜 3=平 4=对手退出 5=断线超时
    }

    class PlayerState {
        +string uid
        +string name
        +boolean ready
        +number score           // 最新一手进度(score/steps/over 仅三标量, 不传棋盘)
        +number steps
        +boolean over
        +number updatedAt       // lastSeen: 用于 stale>600s → abandoned 判定
        +boolean left           // 主动 leave 标记 → matchResult=4
    }

    class ResultState {
        +string uid
        +number score
        +number steps
        +number ts
        +boolean won            // 是否先到2048
    }

    class RoomService {
        +create(uid, name) Room
        +join(code, uid, name) Room
        +progress(code, uid, p) void
        +getState(code, uid) RoomView
        +submitResult(code, uid, r) void
        +leave(code, uid) void
        +reset(code) void        // 再来一局: 新seed, 回waiting, 清进度
        -computeMatch(room) number
        -makeSeed() number
        -makeCode() string
    }

    class SeededRng {
        <<frontend util>>
        +makeRng(seedStr) function
        -xmur3(str) function
        -mulberry32(a) function
    }

    class Store {
        <<interface>>
        +roomSet(code, room)
        +roomGet(code) Room
        +roomProgress(code, uid, p)
        +roomResult(code, uid, r)
        +roomTouch(code)        // 读后 EXPIRE 续期600s
    }

    RoomService ..> Store : uses
    RoomService ..> SeededRng : 建房生成seed(服务端仅存数值)
    Room "1" *-- "2" PlayerState
    Room "1" *-- "2" ResultState
    SeededRng ..> Logic : 注入 rng 使同房同种子(客户端)

    note for RoomService "computeMatch: 任一方won→该方胜; 否则到点比分高者胜, 平分=3; 终局顺序 left→stale→results齐→超时"
    note for SeededRng "仅前端用: initGame(makeRng(seed))/move(...,rng) 必须每次传同一rng实例"
    note for Room "matchResult: 0未定 1=P1 2=P2 3=平 4=对手退出(opponent_left) 5=断线超时(abandoned)"
